{"ref":"character:she-moon-eeta","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["She-Moon Eeta is a playable character from the base game version of Vampire Survivors that was introduced in Patch 1.7.0. Her starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Glass_Fandango.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:glass-fandango"}," ",{"t":"Glass Fandango","r":"weapon:glass-fandango"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["19 October 2023 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["She-Moon"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["SHEMOONITA"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["CharacterControllerSheMoonIta"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Glass_Fandango.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:glass-fandango"}," ",{"t":"Glass Fandango","r":"weapon:glass-fandango"}]]},{"label":"Hidden weapon","cells":[["None"]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Survive 20 min in ",{"t":"Whiteout","r":"stage:whiteout"},"."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[["No"]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Armor","cells":[["+2"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+20%"]]},{"label":"Revival","cells":[["-"]]},{"label":"Luck","cells":[["-"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Upon surviving to the 20:00 mark in ",{"t":"Whiteout","r":"stage:whiteout"},", She-Moon Eeta is unlocked as a playable character."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once unlocked, She-Moon Eeta must then be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, She-Moon Eeta can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"cygnusmagnus\"."]}],"subs":[{"id":"unlocking-reborn-she-moon-eeta","title":"Reborn She-Moon Eeta","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Completing the Adventure To End an Ice Age for the first time unlocks an alternative ",{"t":"skin","r":"relic:mindbender"}," named Reborn She-Moon Eeta."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Reborn She-Moon Eeta can be unlocked in the Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane by casting the Spell \"rebirdshemoon\"."]}]}]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["She-Moon starts with +2 ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," and +20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Wings.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["She-Moon has an \"HP-Critical\" skill that activates as soon as her HP drops below 20% of her ",{"i":"Sprite-Hollow_Heart.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},", which freezes all enemies for 10 seconds once triggered, similar to an ",{"i":"Sprite-Orologion.png","w":24,"h":24}," Orologion pickup. The skill may only be activated again after recovering all HP. Receiving fatal damage resulting in a game-over will not trigger the skill."]}],"subs":[{"id":"passive-bonuses-reborn-she-moon-eeta","title":"Reborn She-Moon Eeta","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Compared to She-Moon, Reborn She-Moon starts with +100% ",{"i":"Sprite-Clover.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},", +7 ",{"i":"Sprite-Tirajisú.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:revival"}," ",{"t":"Revival","r":"powerup:revival"},"s, and level 5 ",{"i":"Sprite-Wings.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:wings"}," ",{"t":"Wings","r":"passive:wings"},". She also has the ",{"i":"Sprite-Valkyrie_Turner.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:valkyrie-turner"}," ",{"t":"Valkyrie Turner","r":"weapon:valkyrie-turner"}," as a hidden weapon."]}]}]},{"id":"darkana","title":"Darkana","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["After obtaining the ",{"i":"Sprite-Darkasso.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:darkasso"}," ",{"t":"Darkasso","r":"relic:darkasso"},", an initially hidden achievement is revealed to the player."]},{"k":"quote","c":["XII - Crystal Cries: Trigger a Starry Heavens with She-Moon Eeta."]},{"k":"p","c":["Completing this achievement will unlock the Darkana: ",{"i":"Sprite-Crystal_Cries_(XII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:crystal-cries-xii"}," ",{"t":"Crystal Cries (XII)","r":"arcana:crystal-cries-xii"},"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Her starting weapon and her passive make her well-suited to run a freezing build. ",{"i":"Sprite-Clock_Lancet.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:clock-lancet"}," ",{"t":"Clock Lancet","r":"weapon:clock-lancet"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Jail_of_Crystal_(XIV).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:jail-of-crystal-xiv"}," ",{"t":"Jail of Crystal (XIV)","r":"arcana:jail-of-crystal-xiv"}," can serve as a way to set enemies up for massive damage from Glass Fandango or ",{"i":"Sprite-Celestial_Voulge.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:celestial-voulge"}," ",{"t":"Celestial Voulge","r":"weapon:celestial-voulge"},". ",{"i":"Sprite-Out_of_Bounds_(XII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:out-of-bounds-xii"}," ",{"t":"Out of Bounds (XII)","r":"weapon:out-of-bounds-xii"}," generates additional value from freezing enemies and increases the number of Orologions spawned, synergizing with Celestial Voulge."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-She-Moon_Eeta.png","w":117,"h":120,"c":["Default She-Moon sprite."]},{"i":"Sprite-Reborn_She-Moon_Eeta.png","w":86,"h":120,"c":["Reborn She-Moon sprite."]},{"i":"Unlock-She-Moon_Eeta.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Unlocks menu icon."]},{"i":"Splash-She-Moon_Eeta.png","w":94,"h":120,"c":["She-Moon sprite used for the main menu of the adventure \"To End an Ice Age.\""]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-animated-sprites","title":"Animated sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Animated-She-Moon_Eeta.gif","w":98,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation of She-Moon Eeta sprite."]},{"i":"Animated-Reborn_She-Moon_Eeta.gif","w":82,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation of Reborn She-Moon Eeta sprite."]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-other","title":"Other","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"To_End_an_Ice_Age.jpg","w":300,"h":169,"c":["She-Moon as depicted in the main menu of the adventure \"To End an Ice Age.\""]}]}]}]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["She-Moon Eeta's name is a play on the Italian insult \"scimunita\", which means \"idiot\"."]},{"c":["She-Moon Eeta's design is a partial reference to ",{"t":"Shiva","x":"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Shiva"},", a recurring ",{"t":"summon","x":"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Summoned_monster"}," from the ",{"t":"Final Fantasy","x":"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Final_Fantasy_series"}," series, particularly in her ",{"t":"Final Fantasy X","x":"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Final_Fantasy_X"}," incarnation."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}